208 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (Established in 2008, Bangladesh University of Professionals \(BUP\) is a public university run by Bangladesh Armed Forces in Mirpur, Cantonment, Dhaka, Bangladesh. It aims to facilitate professional degrees and to run undergraduate, graduate, and postgraduate degrees through its faculties, affiliated institutes, academics, and organizations. Bangladesh University of Professionals emerges as a leading university for both professionals and general students through need-based education and research. The military administration at BUP enables a structured and controlled establishment where safety and security are given the utmost priority. All in all, Bangladesh University of Professionals upholds itself as a reputed institution that ensures a safe environment to learn and grow.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
